ure><figure><img alt=\"兩人比心合影。（Instagram@saika_trip_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260211/1098273119732502528153746.png/8WVlFNOiGFTkMjtC385oc6RT6fsScFQ4jbnqCI256gg\"/><figcaption>兩人比心合影。（Instagram@saika_trip_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人比心合影。（Instagram@saika_trip_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260211/1098273122081443840198670.png/QPEdhrjrjjNm6nmDFRcCQSlYUVu-kKXW1paK-taWivo\"/><figcaption>兩人比心合影。（Instagram@saika_trip_official）</figcaption></figure><p>影／基隆連日大雨釀災 通明街土石崩落民宅壓頂砸毀汽車</p><p>Uber Eats外送員毒駕被警察抓 等不到炸雞他直接到場自取</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T11:39:25.138230+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2256,"images":35,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}